{%- comment -%}
  Alternative text of a product photo. With no alt in the catalog, the product title and its
  position ("Image 3 of 8"): ten photos with the same alt were announced as the same photo. With a
  single photo the title is enough.
  Accepts:
    - media: product media object
    - product: product object
  Returns unescaped text; whoever prints it escapes it (image_tag or escape_once).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if media.alt != blank -%}
  {{- media.alt -}}
{%- elsif product.media.size > 1 -%}
  {{- product.title }} – {{ 'products.product.media_zoom.image_index' | t: index: media.position, total: product.media.size -}}
{%- else -%}
  {{- product.title -}}
{%- endif -%}
